{"text":"One morning, the sand pit is frozen solid. So you work down the list on the wall. You dry grubs hard on a flat stone by the fire, the way you dried fish. They'll keep for weeks. You bring snow inside, melt it by the fire, and pour it through sand and charcoal, because this snow is full of ash. One tick. Then another. But two lines on the wall still have question marks. Your tunnel was built to survive the impact.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["O","n","e"," ","m","o","r","n","i","n","g",","," ","t","h","e"," ","s","a","n","d"," ","p","i","t"," ","i","s"," ","f","r","o","z","e","n"," ","s","o","l","i","d","."," ","S","o"," ","y","o","u"," ","w","o","r","k"," ","d","o","w","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","l","i","s","t"," ","o","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","w","a","l","l","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","d","r","y"," ","g","r","u","b","s"," ","h","a","r","d"," ","o","n"," ","a"," ","f","l","a","t"," ","s","t","o","n","e"," ","b","y"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","e",","," ","t","h","e"," ","w","a","y"," ","y","o","u"," ","d","r","i","e","d"," ","f","i","s","h","."," ","T","h","e","y","'","l","l"," ","k","e","e","p"," ","f","o","r"," ","w","e","e","k","s","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","b","r","i","n","g"," ","s","n","o","w"," ","i","n","s","i","d","e",","," ","m","e","l","t"," ","i","t"," ","b","y"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","e",","," ","a","n","d"," ","p","o","u","r"," ","i","t"," ","t","h","r","o","u","g","h"," ","s","a","n","d"," ","a","n","d"," ","c","h","a","r","c","o","a","l",","," ","b","e","c","a","u","s","e"," ","t","h","i","s"," ","s","n","o","w"," ","i","s"," ","f","u","l","l"," ","o","f"," ","a","s","h","."," ","O","n","e"," ","t","i","c","k","."," ","T","h","e","n"," ","a","n","o","t","h","e","r","."," ","B","u","t"," ","t","w","o"," ","l","i","n","e","s"," ","o","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","w","a","l","l"," ","s","t","i","l","l"," ","h","a","v","e"," ","q","u","e","s","t","i","o","n"," ","m","a","r","k","s